 CBProbe args;want;got;bad;i;n
⍝ Hammer the synchronous WG round-trip and report whether every reply came
⍝ back to the session that asked. eWG parks the session thread on a ⎕TGET
⍝ token that EWC's Listen thread ⎕TPUTs to; under Multi that token is
⍝ per-session

 n←8
 want←⍕⎕THIS
 bad←''

 :Trap 0
     :For i :In ⍳n
         got←∊'F1.TOKEN'eWG'Text'
         :If got≢want
             bad,←' ',got
         :EndIf
         {}'F1'eWG'Size'
     :EndFor

     :If 0=≢bad
         'F1.PROBE'eWS'Caption'('OK ',want,' x',⍕n)
     :Else
         'F1.PROBE'eWS'Caption'('CROSSED ',want,' got:',bad)
     :EndIf
 :Else
     ⍝ Surface a WG timeout as text, so the JS test reports it rather than hangs
     'F1.PROBE'eWS'Caption'('ERROR ',∊⊃⎕DMX.DM)
 :EndTrap
